                "text": "To our LGBTQIA+ family in St. Louis & everywhere,\n\nFrom the Equality Act & Medicare for All\u2014inclusive of mental health services & gender-affirming care\u2014to banning conversion therapy & more, I stand w/ you in celebrating your authentic selves.\n\nYour Congresswoman loves you. #PRIDE",
