                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I know what it's like to be uninsured. And, as a nurse, I've seen patients ration medication & skip treatments because they couldn't afford it. I've seen people die because our for-profit healthcare system put their shareholders' profits over people.\n\nWe need Medicare For All.",
